@ProductsAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Liste des produits
GET {{ProductsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Product
Accept: application/json

### Produit par id
GET {{ProductsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Product/1
Accept: application/json

### Produit inexistant
GET {{ProductsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Product/99999
Accept: application/json

### Créer un produit
POST {{ProductsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "RGB keyboard",
  "price": 149.99,
  "stock": 12
}

### Modifier un produit
PUT {{ProductsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Product/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Laptop Pro",
  "description": "Updated laptop",
  "price": 1800.00,
  "stock": 8
}

### Supprimer un produit
DELETE {{ProductsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Product/4

### Swagger
GET {{ProductsAPI_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json
